OL,3,GNEWSABomb threats reported against
OL,4,Amultiple flights across Europe for
OL,5,Asecond time this week
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier an aircraft was escorted into
OL,8,FRome Fiumicino Airport by Italian Air
OL,9,FForce jets, while the Bulgarian
OL,10,Fmilitary says it deployed its Air Force
OL,11,Ffighter jets to escort three aircraft
OL,12,Fto Sofia
OL,14,FAir traffic control messages analysed
OL,15,Fby BBC Verify show one diverted
OL,16,Faircraft - travelling from Dublin to
OL,17,FRome - was alerted to a potential
OL,18,Fthreat by air traffic control
OL,20,FOn Tuesday, at least seven flights were
OL,21,Fhit by similar threats - no explosives
OL,22,Fwere found
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
